WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.029
"Wake up, Farmer!" yelled Farmer's wife.

2
00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:09.860
"You have work to do!"

3
00:00:09.861 --> 00:00:13.040
Farmer's wife was not happy.

4
00:00:13.041 --> 00:00:16.419
Farmer was napping again.

5
00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:21.522
Cow was not napping.

6
00:00:21.523 --> 00:00:24.433
She was hooping.

7
00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:27.935
She was getting ready for the contest.

8
00:00:27.936 --> 00:00:34.852
She hooped.

9
00:00:34.853 --> 00:00:40.072
And she hooped.

10
00:00:40.073 --> 00:01:00.010
And she hooped!

11
00:01:00.011 --> 00:01:06.022
The next day Cow woke up.

12
00:01:06.023 --> 00:01:09.019
She looked around.

13
00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.799
Her new hula hoop was gone!

14
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:23.058
Cow looked all over the barn.

15
00:01:23.059 --> 00:01:29.438
She looked in the field.

16
00:01:29.439 --> 00:01:42.448
She looked near the tractor.

17
00:01:42.449 --> 00:01:48.488
She looked in the pond.

18
00:01:48.489 --> 00:01:53.108
But she did not see her hula hoop.

19
00:01:53.109 --> 00:01:56.275
She did not see it anywhere.

20
00:01:56.276 --> 00:02:04.460
Cow ran back to the barn.

21
00:02:04.461 --> 00:02:07.528
"Moo!" she cried.

22
00:02:07.529 --> 00:02:11.853
"Moo! Moo! Moo!"

23
00:02:11.854 --> 00:02:16.763
Cat and Pig ran to Cow.

24
00:02:16.764 --> 00:02:19.496
Bat flew to Cow.

25
00:02:19.497 --> 00:02:22.892
Cow tried not to cry.

26
00:02:22.893 --> 00:02:26.891
"Today is the contest," Cow said.

27
00:02:26.892 --> 00:02:33.299
"And my new hula hoop is gone!"

